    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How quick to answer, Doctor of Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "A safe location has been sent to Alexandrina's terminal. Please stand by there. I cannot guarantee your safety for any actions you take outside of our arrangement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My terminal? When did...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have some impressive talents among your ranks. That's very good. This should contribute to our common goal instead of becoming an obstacle to our cooperation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "This isn't completely up to us.;......;Is it a Victorian thing to call threats cooperation?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. We must slowly build our trust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A cautious silence. How admirable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regrettably, yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please await our next communication.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage",
        "channel": "n",
        "loop": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "n",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
