    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, I need to contact Closure and reevaluate the safety of Rhodes Island's communications. Until then, maintain radio silence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, we also need to... take care of the issues regarding the landship's calling procedures.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#7$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Ines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Hello, Ines. Is this the first time we've met?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I've lost... some of my memories.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm aware.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is our first meeting, for this version of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you really lost your memories...? Or is this part of your plan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#14$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I forgot about lots of things, indeed.;......;What makes you ask that?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never been quick to judge, Dr. {@nickname}. I can sense that you've gone through some... changes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have a lot of time to get reacquainted in the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rather than trusting verbal statements, I prefer to see things for myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines, the Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, Amiya. My prejudices won't be a factor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "For now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
