    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_414_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Sarkaz from Rhodes Island. Is his name Logos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I thought we'd seen all the surprises Rhodes Island's fighting style had to offer, having fought alongside Misery all this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_414_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. It doesn't matter who exactly he is. His cursecraft has been a great help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_398_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah... and he's a great darts player, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I played against him for a couple rounds. His accuracy might just be as terrifying as those Arts of his.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A friend of mine taught me a couple tricks before, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's no match for me in a chair sliding match, but when it comes to darts... He's not so bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Horn, the Sarkaz forces have retreated. We should seize this opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "According to the plan, Rhodes Island and the Self-Salvation Corps will take the supply route, head toward the exit, and make their way to a town called Brentwood to build a new safe house there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will regroup with them there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suggest we charge toward the city walls. Norport Borough is gone, and even though the Sarkaz have patched up the walls, they wouldn't have had enough time to build new plates to fill the hole there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "The exposed underground structure might just help us somehow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
