        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like I've met another old friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_398_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one who taught you to play darts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regrettably, no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unlike this old friend, my friends are loyal to one another until our deaths.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, I'm afraid I still have matters to attend to within the city. Horn is more than capable of leading you outside Londinium, and my coworker Misery will also lend you his assistance should the need arise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay hidden, everyone. Follow me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
