    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are the mountains of the past really so worthy of reminiscing? Blood and tears are nothing to be obsessed with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must say I'm not entirely fascinated by them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what if the mountains are the only place there is left to stay? What if only the light of glory there can give us warmth?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "And here I thought I'd hunted enough of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the thirty-first 'Molly.' You are a hardworking one, Banshee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you prevailed nonetheless. You helped Theresis decimate the Self-Salvation Corps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would pry up every tile in Londinium to find the last of your hidden shards, Damazti.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "You yet refute the possibility of change. This has always been your choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_humanchange"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A little arrogant, aren't we, young Banshee? We understand change. We come from change itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But change is merely a means to adaptation. All change has a final objective.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even before the Sarkaz found themselves in this state, we had long been walking upon the lands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ideologies, faiths, missions, slogans. None of them can escape the sands of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those ideas you mistake as novel have been conceived long ago. The paths you deem noble have been paved time and again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And where are they now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "We yet still before you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that is the greatest proof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
