    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should save some strength, Cador. You've eaten more than enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delphine has talked to you about your appetite problem already. We're much worse off than we used to be now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, Baird. Things haven't completely gone to shit yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "Them devils aren't nearly as strong as they look. All they did was catch us off-guard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had a chat with Marshall from the transport union. They have a group of men over there. Once we rope in more people on our end, we might just stand a chance to defeat the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how we joined forces with those other gangs to take the cops down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jump them from behind, get the job done clean. 'Pow pow,' 'bam!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A couple punches. That's all it takes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz army isn't cops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. They're a force to be reckoned with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we aren't afraid of blood. We aren't afraid of sacrifices! We will walk over our fallen comrades, and smash their faces in with our fists\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like our gym's name, 'Slobberknocker!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "Marshall and I worked it out. We will definitely win!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like those bootleg Lungmen videos you collect, hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm serious, I've been around the block in Norport not much shorter than you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to find a way out of this mess ourselves just like before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Siege of yours just up and left Glasgow all those years ago, and our turf got handed over, just like that. It was you and I who racked our brains to figure out how to gain a foothold here again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is nothing different than before. We stand together, get prepared, and beat them all up. That's how we've made it this far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter how things are outside. Out on the streets, we do things the street way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next, we just gotta find ourselves the right moment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
