        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Ol' Baldy Per finally give in? Given the circumstances, we're paying a pretty decent price. I'm sure he\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this? Is that... blood?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$calamity_intro",
        "key": "$calamity_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ol' Baldy Per is dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not the Sarkaz! Dammit, I have no idea who they were, but they were already at it when we got to the store!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "They were a bloodthirsty bunch! I saw with my own eyes there was this man with a crowbar, pinning another man on the floor. That man even\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 12,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*, *cough* *cough*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation's bad. My guess is some starving bum set his sights on Per's shop. The idiot still had bread in his glass showcase.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it went as you'd expect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can more or less guess just how many of these 'bums' there are in this locked-down district.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bloody idiots... Whatever they have been sniffing must've finally got to their heads!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know the man with the crowbar. He's a tail hair product salesman. Always had a smile on his face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "text": "I bought from him a number of times since he gave me discounts. They aren't all that good, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw him just now... His eyes were deep red, there was blood on his lips. That crowbar was completely bent. I... I almost didn't recognize him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fear is spreading, Cador.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The transport union guys did say there could be cowards going nuts, but how could...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
