    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Barricade the door!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you spacing out for? Make yourself useful! Cador, push that sofa over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bloody bastards, what do the lot of you want?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#7$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Outside the Door"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now piss off, we've got people alive in here. This is Glasgow's territory!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#7$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Outside the Door"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird, watch out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_axeimp",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
